  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://github.com/BlueSheep2804/ToggleVisualize/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/BlueSheep2804/ToggleVisualize?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"GitHub 授權\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_vector.svg\" alt=\"fabric\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/forge_vector.svg\" alt=\"forge\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/BlueSheep2804/ToggleVisualize/refs/heads/main/images/neoforge-badge.svg\" alt=\"neoforge\"></p><h1>切換狀態視覺化</h1><h2>功能特色</h2><h3>・視覺化顯示以下切換狀態：</h3><ul>\n<li>控制<ul>\n<li>潛行</li>\n<li>衝刺</li>\n<li>攻擊/破壞方塊（1.21.9+）</li>\n<li>使用物品/放置方塊（1.21.9+）</li></ul></li>\n<li>玩家<ul>\n<li>創造模式飛行</li>\n<li>鞘翅滑翔</li>\n<li>游泳</li>\n<li>爬行</li></ul></li>\n<li>圖示與文字的位置和大小可在 GUI 中調整。</li>\n<li>支援 Fabric 與 Forge / NeoForge 模組載入器。</li>\n</ul><h2>依賴項目</h2><h3>Fabric</h3><ul>\n<li>Fabric API</li>\n<li>Fabric Language Kotlin</li>\n<li>YetAnotherConfigLib</li>\n</ul><h3>Forge / NeoForge</h3><ul>\n<li>Kotlin for Forge</li>\n<li>YetAnotherConfigLib</li>\n</ul><hr><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fbluesheep\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-singular-alt_vector.svg\" alt=\"kofi-singular-alt\"></a></p>",
